  "mach:maturity": "beta",
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Solid WSI preprocessing library with a clean API for tissue detection, tiling, and stain normalisation. Apache-2.0, pip-installable, well-documented. 457 stars — smaller community than pathml but more focused in scope. Assess rather than Adopt due to modest maintenance activity and community size. A good choice for teams building digital pathology pipelines who want a lightweight, purpose-built tile extraction library.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-12",

